@host = http://localhost:5201
@apiKey = REPLACE_WITH_THE_KEY_FROM_appsettings.Development.json

### Health — the only route that needs no key
GET {{host}}/health

### List all bots (admin view)
GET {{host}}/api/bots
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List only enabled bots (public view)
GET {{host}}/api/bots?enabled=true
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a bot
POST {{host}}/api/bots
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Support Demo",
  "description": "Customer support assistant",
  "scriptCode": "<script src=\"https://example.com/bot.js\"></script>",
  "category": "customer-support"
}

### Fetch by slug
GET {{host}}/api/bots/by-slug/support-demo
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List demo websites
GET {{host}}/api/websites
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a demo website
POST {{host}}/api/websites
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pearl",
  "description": "E-commerce demo storefront",
  "url": "https://pearl.ambot365.com/",
  "category": "e-commerce",
  "tags": ["storefront", "retail"],
  "featured": true
}

### Rejected: unknown category returns 400
POST {{host}}/api/websites
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad Category",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "category": "not-a-category"
}

### Rejected: missing key returns 401
GET {{host}}/api/bots
